Configurations/10-main.conf:# - Originally we were optimizing at +O4 level. It should be noted
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   that the only difference between +O3 and +O4 is global inter-
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   stage the compiler leaves behind certain pseudo-code in lib*.a
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   HP-UX data set size limit (infamous 'maxdsiz' tunable) of 64MB
