Configurations/10-main.conf:# - originally there were 32-bit hpux-parisc2-* targets. They were
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   scrapped, because a) they were not interchangeable with other 32-bit
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   targets; b) performance-critical 32-bit assembly modules implement
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   even PA-RISC 2.0-specific code paths, which are chosen at run-time,
Configurations/10-main.conf:#   thus adequate performance is provided even with PA-RISC 1.1 build.
