crypto/bn/asm/parisc-mont.pl:# instruction scheduling. In 64-bit build naturally only 2.0 code path
crypto/bn/asm/parisc-mont.pl:# is assembled. In 32-bit application context both code paths are
crypto/bn/asm/parisc-mont.pl:# assembled, PA-RISC 2.0 CPU is detected at run-time and proper path
