doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:The supported algorithms names include TLS1-PRF, HKDF, SSKDF, PBKDF2,
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:SSHKDF, X942KDF-ASN1, X942KDF-CONCAT, X963KDF and SCRYPT.
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use TLS1-PRF to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key and seed:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 16 -kdfopt digest:SHA2-256 -kdfopt key:secret \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt seed:seed TLS1-PRF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use HKDF to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key, salt and info:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 10 -kdfopt digest:SHA2-256 -kdfopt key:secret \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt salt:salt -kdfopt info:label HKDF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use SSKDF with KMAC to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key, salt and info:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 64 -kdfopt mac:KMAC-128 -kdfopt maclen:20 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexkey:b74a149a161545 -kdfopt hexinfo:348a37a2 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexsalt:3638271ccd68a2 SSKDF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use SSKDF with HMAC to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key, salt and info:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 16 -kdfopt mac:HMAC -kdfopt digest:SHA2-256 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexkey:b74a149a -kdfopt hexinfo:348a37a2 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexsalt:3638271c SSKDF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use SSKDF with Hash to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key, salt and info:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 14 -kdfopt digest:SHA2-256 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexkey:6dbdc23f045488 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexinfo:a1b2c3d4 SSKDF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use SSHKDF to create a hex-encoded derived key from a secret key, hash and session_id:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 16 -kdfopt digest:SHA2-256 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexkey:0102030405 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexxcghash:06090A \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt hexsession_id:01020304 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt type:A SSHKDF
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use PBKDF2 to create a hex-encoded derived key from a password and salt:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 32 -kdfopt digest:SHA256 -kdfopt pass:password \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt salt:salt -kdfopt iter:2 PBKDF2
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:Use scrypt to create a hex-encoded derived key from a password and salt:
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:    openssl kdf -keylen 64 -kdfopt pass:password -kdfopt salt:NaCl \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt n:1024 -kdfopt r:8 -kdfopt p:16 \
doc/man1/openssl-kdf.pod.in:                -kdfopt maxmem_bytes:10485760 SCRYPT
