doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:To create a hex-encoded HMAC-SHA1 MAC of a file and write to stdout:
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in: openssl mac -digest SHA1 \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -macopt hexkey:000102030405060708090A0B0C0D0E0F10111213 \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -in msg.bin HMAC
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in: openssl mac -macopt hexkey:000102030405060708090A0B0C0D0E0F \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -in msg.bin -out out.bin -binary SipHash
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:To create a hex-encoded CMAC-AES-128-CBC MAC from a file:
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in: openssl mac -cipher AES-128-CBC \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -macopt hexkey:77A77FAF290C1FA30C683DF16BA7A77B \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -in msg.bin CMAC
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:To create a hex-encoded KMAC128 MAC from a file with a Customisation String
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in: openssl mac -macopt custom:Tag -macopt hexkey:40414243444546 \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -macopt size:16 -in msg.bin KMAC128
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:To create a hex-encoded GMAC-AES-128-GCM with a IV from a file:
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in: openssl mac -cipher AES-128-GCM -macopt hexiv:E0E00F19FED7BA0136A797F3 \
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:         -macopt hexkey:77A77FAF290C1FA30C683DF16BA7A77B -in msg.bin GMAC
doc/man1/openssl-mac.pod.in:Use C<openssl list -mac-algorithms> to list them.
