test/README-external.md:--------------------------
test/README-external.md:You will need a git checkout of gost-engine at the top level:
test/README-external.md:    $ git submodule update --init
test/README-external.md:    $ ./config shared enable-external-tests
test/README-external.md:- Make sure the submodules are cloned locally:
test/README-external.md:    $ git submodule update --init --recursive
test/README-external.md:- Enter subdirectory and pull from the repository (use a specific branch/tag if required):
test/README-external.md:    $ cd `<submodule-dir>`
test/README-external.md:- Go to root directory, there should be a new git status:
test/README-external.md:      #       modified:   `<submodule-dir>` (new commits)
test/README-external.md:- Add/commit/push the update
test/README-external.md:    $ git add `<submodule-dir>`
test/README-external.md:    $ git commit -m `"Updated <submodule> to latest commit"`
